<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech MST posts CZK 510mln '96 gross.</title>
<headline>Czech MST posts CZK 510mln '96 gross.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for year ending December 31 1996 (in millions of crowns).</p>
<p>					 1996	 vs   1995</p>
<p> Gross profit			  510.00	     626.76</p>
<p> Sales of own products	   3,690.OOO	  2,997.526</p>
<p>and services</p>
<p> Revenues			    4,014.000	     n/a</p>
<p> Assets				   n/a	     4,958.530</p>
<p> Basic capital		     2,507.542	  2,507.542</p>
<p>Note: The company's full name is Moravskoslezske Teplarny a.s. It is a regional heating company.</p>
